welcome to analog I'm Lisa foils here on  probably the most helpful show on the  internet we care about finding you more  games like the ones you already love and  today we're talking Dark Souls 2 the  brooding fantasy action RPG with  ruthless difficulty that is back to kill  you you loved it you braved it you  somehow miraculously finished it and now  you want more here are games similar to  Dark Souls 2 we'll assume you already  checked out Dark Souls 1 and Demon Souls  because well those would be similar to  Dark Souls 2 they're the same franchise  but you will also like Dragon's Dogma  what makes it similar to Dark Souls 2  well first they're both hack and slash  errs with survival horror elements plus  they both have huge open worlds  expansive fantasy settings that you can  explore at your own pace Francis and  during League are full of secret areas  branching off in odd ways allowing you  to have a hell of a good time exploring  the land before ever starting a story  quest Dragon's Dogma has a much more  in-depth story compared to the vague  plot of Dark Souls 2 though they are  both about revenge  in Dark Souls 2 you're on a quest to get  your curse removed and in Dragon's Dogma  you're after the dragon who ate your  heart that's not ok both games are sort  of grim brutal fairy tales  however Dragon's Dogma isn't as grueling  and lonely as dark souls 2 we all know  Dark Souls has one goal to kill you over  and over Dragon's Dogma is more  forgiving plus you have party members  called pawns both you and your main pond  are fully customizable and a lot of the  classes or vocations are similar in both  games I assure you you will die a lot  less in Dragon's Dogma though careful  when riding on a Griffin because that  thing will just tip you right off  my next suggestion has to be the Monster  Hunter games will say Monster Hunter 3  ultimate the combat will feel very  similar slow and deliberate with a focus  on timing evasion and health management  every game 