ay of  skill today but if beating it left you  thinking you're this amazing gamer who  can beat any game then I dare you to try  ghosts and goblins for the NES  this classic is one of the hardest games  ever made you're a knight trying to save  a princess from ghoulish horrors get hit  once and you lose your armor and you're  left running around in your undies get  hit a second time and you just die  you're just a pathetic pile of bones  test your skills test your sanity and  try not to have a brain aneurysm that's  really all we ask leave me a comment and  add to my suggestions which games do you  think are like Dark Souls 2 follow me on  twitter at lisa foils and come back next  week for another episode of analog
 

